   "id": "s0",
   "title": "First ratio",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\dfrac{ {}^{n}C_{r}}{ {}^{n}C_{r-1}}=\\dfrac{n-r+1}{r}=\\dfrac{14}{6}=\\dfrac{7}{3}\\\\[5pt]&3n-3r+3=7r\\;\\Rightarrow\\;3n=10r-3\\qquad(1)\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
