     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Solve the two equations",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&n=\\dfrac{5r+3}{2}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\dfrac{3(5r+3)}{2}=10r-3\\\\[5pt]&15r+9=20r-6\\;\\Rightarrow\\;r=3\\\\[5pt]&n=\\dfrac{15+3}{2}=9\\\\[5pt]&\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{n=9,\\ r=3}}\\end{aligned}\\]",
